[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3840.63, "timestamp": "01:04:00", "text": "非活動狀態時，關閉檔案。是的。嗯，是的。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3843.51, "timestamp": "01:04:03", "text": "視訊媒體檔案總是會放到 webbump"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3846.549, "timestamp": "01:04:06", "text": "檔案裡，因為 MP4 會佔用大量的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3850.15, "timestamp": "01:04:10", "text": "處理能力和資源。  是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3852.87, "timestamp": "01:04:12", "text": "啊，所有這些東西。是的，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3855.029, "timestamp": "01:04:15", "text": "這樣做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3858.15, "timestamp": "01:04:18", "text": "如果你實在太累太懶，不想做這些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3860.549, "timestamp": "01:04:20", "text": "，那就安裝 def source"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3862.47, "timestamp": "01:04:22", "text": "default 插件，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3865.91, "timestamp": "01:04:25", "text": "然後像這樣建立一個預設來源。添加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3868.95, "timestamp": "01:04:28", "text": "所有來源類型，進行設置，所有的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3871.029, "timestamp": "01:04:31", "text": "一切，隨你喜歡。只需新增一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3873.829, "timestamp": "01:04:33", "text": "過濾器來源預設值即可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3877.589, "timestamp": "01:04:37", "text": "它會將這些來源視為父"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3881.109, "timestamp": "01:04:41", "text": "來源，以及你所創造的任何子來源"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3883.75, "timestamp": "01:04:43", "text": "。例如，當你建立一個新的影像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3886.789, "timestamp": "01:04:46", "text": "場景時，它會自動複製場景的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3890.63, "timestamp": "01:04:50", "text": "所有設置，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3892.789, "timestamp": "01:04:52", "text": "包括設定、濾鏡、音訊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3894.47, "timestamp": "01:04:54", "text": "軌道等等，所有你在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3897.43, "timestamp": "01:04:57", "text": "父級來源上設定的內容都會被複製。是的，它會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3899.829, "timestamp": "01:04:59", "text": "複製一份，讓孩子也能做到"}]